Required:
- Import only the icons you use from `lucide-react`.
- Use icons to clarify navigation, status, actions, metrics, and feature cards.
- Provide accessible text labels nearby; do not rely on icons as the only label.
- Keep icon sizes and stroke colors consistent with the surrounding UI.

Forbidden:
- Do not import the entire icon library or use wildcard imports.
- Do not use icons as decorative clutter when text alone is clearer.
